 <!DOCTYPE html>
  <html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>PocketNest - Family Pocket Money Manager</title>
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">
  </head>
  <body>
<%- include('partials/header') %>
<section class="hero">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="hero-content">
      <div class="hero-badge">
        <span class="badge-dot"></span>
        Smart Pocket Money Management for Modern Families
      </div>
      <h1>Teach Your Kids <span class="highlight">Financial Responsibility</span> the Fun Way</h1>
      <p class="hero-description">PocketNest helps parents manage allowances, track spending, and teach children valuable money skills — all in one beautiful, secure app.</p>
      <div class="hero-actions">
        <a href="/register?role=parent" class="btn btn-primary btn-lg">
          <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
            <path d="M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"/>
            <circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"/>
            <path d="M22 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87"/>
            <path d="M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75"/>
          </svg>
          Start as Parent
        </a>
        <a href="/register?role=child" class="btn btn-secondary btn-lg">
          <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
            <path d="M17 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H5a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"/>
            <circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"/>
            <path d="M23 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87"/>
            <path d="M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75"/>
          </svg>
          Join as Child
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-visual">
      <div class="phone-mockup">
        <div class="phone-frame">
          <div class="phone-screen">
            <div class="mock-dashboard">
              <div class="mock-header">
                <div class="mock-avatar"></div>
                <div class="mock-info">
                  <div class="mock-name">Arjun's Wallet</div>
                  <div class="mock-balance">₹2,450</div>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="mock-cards">
                <div class="mock-card received">
                  <span class="mock-label">Received</span>
                  <span class="mock-value">₹5,000</span>
                </div>
                <div class="mock-card spent">
                  <span class="mock-label">Spent</span>
                  <span class="mock-value">₹1,200</span>
                </div>
                <div class="mock-card saved">
                  <span class="mock-label">Saved</span>
                  <span class="mock-value">₹3,800</span>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="mock-goal">
                <div class="mock-goal-header">
                  <span>New Bicycle</span>
                  <span>75%</span>
                </div>
                <div class="mock-progress">
                  <div class="mock-progress-bar" style="width: 75%"></div>
                </div>
                <span class="mock-goal-amount">₹3,750 / ₹5,000</span>
              </div>
              <div class="mock-transactions">
                <div class="mock-tx">
                  <span>💰 Allowance</span>
                  <span class="tx-income">+₹1,000</span>
                </div>
                <div class="mock-tx">
                  <span>🎮 Games</span>
                  <span class="tx-expense">-₹500</span>
                </div>
                <div class="mock-tx">
                  <span>📚 Books</span>
                  <span class="tx-expense">-₹300</span>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="features">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header">
      <h2>Everything You Need to <span class="highlight">Manage Family Finances</span></h2>
      <p>Powerful features for both parents and children</p>
    </div>
    <div class="features-grid">
      <article class="feature-card">
        <div class="feature-icon">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
            <rect x="2" y="4" width="20" height="16" rx="2"/>
            <path d="M6 8h12M6 12h12M6 16h8"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Family Management</h3>
        <p>Create families, invite children with unique codes, and manage multiple kids from one dashboard.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="feature-card">
        <div class="feature-icon">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
            <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/>
            <path d="M12 6v6l4 2"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Instant Transfers</h3>
        <p>Add or deduct money instantly. Real-time balance updates across all family members.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="feature-card">
        <div class="feature-icon">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
            <path d="M21 12V7H5V7M3 12h18M7 17h10M12 7v10"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Withdrawal Approvals</h3>
        <p>Children request withdrawals, parents approve or reject. Teaches responsible spending.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="feature-card">
        <div class="feature-icon">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
            <path d="M12 2L2 7l10 5 10-5-10-5zM2 17l10 5 10-5M2 12l10 5 10-5"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Savings Goals</h3>
        <p>Kids create visual savings goals with progress bars. Celebrate milestones together!</p>
      </article>
      <article class="feature-card">
        <div class="feature-icon">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
            <rect x="3" y="4" width="18" height="18" rx="2" ry="2"/>
            <line x1="16" y1="2" x2="16" y2="6"/>
            <line x1="8" y1="2" x2="8" y2="6"/>
            <line x1="3" y1="10" x2="21" y2="10"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Spending Limits</h3>
        <p>Set daily, weekly, or monthly limits. Help children learn budgeting naturally.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="feature-card">
        <div class="feature-icon">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
            <path d="M18 8A6 6 0 0 0 6 8c0 7-3 9-3 9h18s-3-2-3-9"/>
            <path d="M13.73 21a2 2 0 0 1-3.46 0"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Secure & Private</h3>
        <p>Bank-level encryption, bcrypt password hashing, and role-based access control.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="how-it-works">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header">
      <h2>How It <span class="highlight">Works</span></h2>
      <p>Get started in three simple steps</p>
    </div>
    <div class="steps">
      <div class="step">
        <div class="step-number">1</div>
        <h3>Parent Creates Family</h3>
        <p>Sign up as a parent, create your family, and get a unique invitation code.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="step">
        <div class="step-number">2</div>
        <h3>Children Join</h3>
        <p>Kids sign up and join using the invitation code. Each gets their own wallet.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="step">
        <div class="step-number">3</div>
        <h3>Start Managing</h3>
        <p>Add money, set limits, approve requests, and watch savings grow together.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="cta">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="cta-content">
      <h2>Ready to Start Your Family's Financial Journey?</h2>
      <p>Join thousands of families teaching kids smart money habits.</p>
      <div class="cta-actions">
        <a href="/register?role=parent" class="btn btn-primary btn-lg">Create Free Account</a>
        <a href="/login" class="btn btn-outline btn-lg">Login to Existing Account</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<%- include('partials/footer') %>
 </body>
  </html>